{"id":"7e537464587f340f","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-baire-space.md","title":"Baire Space","display":"df-baire-space — Baire Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-baire-space","aliases":["58-df-baire-space","58-df-zfc-metric-baire-space"],"display":"df-baire-space — Baire Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-complete-metric]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-baire-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-baire-space</span><span>58-df-zfc-metric-baire-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-baire-space — Baire Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"58-df-finite-sequence\">58-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"05d80cd20b53d8a2\" href=\"?note=05d80cd20b53d8a2\" title=\"58-df-complete-metric\">58-df-complete-metric</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> (自然数集, 标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N,\\tau,d,H,B\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal N,\\tau,d,H,B\\in V\\)</span> (point set, topology, metric, finite-sequence carrier, and cylinder basis)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\)</span> (function and finite-sequence predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"05d80cd20b53d8a2\" href=\"?note=05d80cd20b53d8a2\" title=\"58-df-complete-metric\">58-df-complete-metric</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathcal N\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathcal N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in H\">\\(\\sigma\\in H\\)</span> (points and a finite sequence)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\mathcal N,\\tau,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists H,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nH=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(\\sigma,\\omega)\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathcal N=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;B=\\bigl\\{\\{f\\in\\mathcal N:\\sigma\\subseteq f\\}:\\sigma\\in H\\bigr\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\tau=\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal N):\\exists\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal P(B)\\;(U=\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathcal N\\times\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal N,\\tau)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathcal N,d)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\left(d(x,y)=\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n2^{-\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\neq y(n)\\}},&amp;x\\neq y\n\\end{cases}\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\mathcal N,\\tau,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists H,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nH=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(\\sigma,\\omega)\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathcal N=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;B=\\bigl\\{\\{f\\in\\mathcal N:\\sigma\\subseteq f\\}:\\sigma\\in H\\bigr\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\tau=\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal N):\\exists\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal P(B)\\;(U=\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\}\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathcal N\\times\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal N,\\tau)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathcal N,d)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\left(d(x,y)=\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;x=y,\\\\\n2^{-\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\neq y(n)\\}},&amp;x\\neq y\n\\end{cases}\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> are bounded sets of function graphs.  The cylinder basis is built from the same finite-sequence carrier, so no free family symbol remains in the topology clause.</li>\n<li>When <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\neq y\">\\(x\\neq y\\)</span>, totality on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> makes the disagreement set nonempty; hence the minimum in the standard complete ultrametric is defined.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complete-metric","status":"resolved","id":"05d80cd20b53d8a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complete-metric]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ and $\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S$ (see [[58-df-topological-space]] and [[58-df-complete-metric]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complete-metric","status":"resolved","id":"05d80cd20b53d8a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ and $\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S$ (see [[58-df-topological-space]] and [[58-df-complete-metric]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N,\\tau,d,H,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{FinSeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathcal N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}baire\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\mathcal N,\\tau,d)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists H,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl[{}&\nH=\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{FinSeq}(\\sigma,\\omega)\\}\\land\\\\\n&\\mathcal N=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\}\\land\\\\\n&B=\\bigl\\{\\{f\\in\\mathcal N:\\sigma\\subseteq f\\}:\\sigma\\in H\\bigr\\}\\land\\\\\n&\\tau=\\{U\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal N):\\exists\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal P(B)\\;(U=\\bigcup\\mathcal U)\\}\\land\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Function}(d,\\mathcal N\\times\\mathcal N,\\mathbb R)\\land\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal N,\\tau)\\land\n\\mathrm{CompleteMetric}_S(\\mathcal N,d)\\land\\\\\n&\\forall x,y\\in\\mathcal N\\;\\left(d(x,y)=\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&x=y,\\\\\n2^{-\\min\\{n\\in\\omega:x(n)\\neq y(n)\\}},&x\\neq y\n\\end{cases}\\right)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\neq y","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2084,"backlinks":[{"id":"2631de10a773dc04","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S$ (canonical Baire-space presentation, see [[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]])"},{"id":"017c1ef35553f80c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal N,\\tau_{\\mathcal N}$ (Baire space and its topology, see [[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]])"},{"id":"db916f1fec757e0b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\exists d_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},d_{\\mathcal N})$（see [[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]]）。"},{"id":"67ec9d5a33dd0df2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal N=\\omega^\\omega$ and $\\tau_{\\mathcal N}$ are the Baire-space carrier and topology (see [[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]])"},{"id":"b35148d7e29aa66f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B$ (coded Baire-space carrier, see [[58-df-baire-space]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-164","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md|58-df-baire-space]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","f4bf86f66c1444da","815e63e5071e7b58","05d80cd20b53d8a2"]}